                                                "sense_id": "a6c35053-4ef1-3a73-97b5-5d06fed9ab14",
                                                "text": "Gatland's side got back to within striking distance when fly-half Jones's clever pass sent centre Jonathan Davies arcing round Shontayne Hape."
