                                                "sense_id": "c718179b-56d2-3d20-a681-e3364775fa7a",
                                                "text": "His mother, her eyes raised to heaven, hands arked before her, moving, made real for John that patience, that endurance, that long suffering, which he had read in the Bible and found so hard to image."
